{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_st01","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_st01","title":"噩梦","storyCode":"CF-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"9bc96dd1dbbfc8a8ec69bd4236f8f9b056a939800b92112c0af723989ad37197","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梦魇般的森林又一次被黑夜笼罩，年老的猎人又一次在其中追逐他的猎物。他的疯狂试图冲刷一切，直到命中注定的巨影掠过他的眼帘。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"活下去。\n怎样都好，活下去。\n无论如何，活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g5_redleaflake"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老家伙，醒醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"潮湿，温暖，柔软，土壤在流动。\n沉默，轻柔，缓慢，意识在下沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还不能在这里倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它会逃掉的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滚烫的月光浇在头颅上，身下的土壤几乎要沸腾起来，濒临破灭的意识被这股热流冲上顶端，灼痛感强迫他睁开双眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，就是这样，站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......昏迷了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"五分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五分钟，我浪费了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大多数时候，一秒钟就能决定一名猎人的生死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这次幸好，你还有时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去湖边，把你的矛捡回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"猎矛，猎人赖以存活的倚仗，如今半截淹没在湖光里。\n他忘记了自己为什么丢下了矛，就像丢下了自己的性命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"矛重新立了起来，矛尖的血腥依旧新鲜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许你需要洗把脸清醒一下，你已经追了三天三夜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过三天，我还没有老到那种程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那头野兽逃到哪里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受伤了，它在森林里走不远，估计现在正在某个阴冷的角落舔舐自己的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森林......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g4_redleafcliff"},{"type":"narration","text":"他向森林里望去，他能看到的，是一具躯壳。\n树干是向上伸展的脊骨，肋骨似张开的枝丫，悬挂着密密麻麻的肉片。\n黑色的脂肪在半空中堆积，满盛鲜活的血浆，如下一刻就会倾泻而下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在恐惧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怀疑是自己在前进，还是森林在逼近，张牙舞爪地朝你扑来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你几乎都要转身逃跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别试图掩饰，你的一切都逃不过我的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是听着，我不会否定你的恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这片森林就是一头怪物，关于它的一切都值得恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一头怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一头噩梦般的怪物，张开它的血盆大口，将生命啃咬撕碎。这就是森林本来的样貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但它并非不可战胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我问你，你还记得我最后的模样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，我永远不会忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愤怒，我愤怒得浑身颤抖，指甲嵌进手掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我要你愤怒，你必须愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你会害怕，会慌乱，会痛苦万分，但愤怒会冲刷掉这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在愤怒面前不会有任何阻碍，森林会因为你的怒火而不堪一击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我会愤怒，我会拔去森林的尖牙，砍下它的利爪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它如何对待你，我就会如何奉还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好，那边有血迹，去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是温热的，它流的血不少，伤口又开裂了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血迹在这里之后就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到树上那些抓痕了吗？仔细观察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"树干被抓得很深，它一定抓了很多次，刮下了大量树皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在痕迹的边缘残留有被血浸透的毛发，地上也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些畜生越来越狡猾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它知道血会暴露踪迹，于是把木屑蹭在伤口上止血，又在原先的痕迹上抓得更深，以掩盖自己的行踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但野兽毕竟是野兽，再细的墨棒擦过白纸也会留下痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苍钩草的果实会附在路过野兽的皮毛上，它们总是喜欢搭顺风车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看那些离开的小家伙们为我们指出了通往何处的道路，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，它进了那个洞穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？那种声音......我从没听过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看来我们有新朋友了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的声音让我很兴奋，说不定会是它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别急，猎人总是专注眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在里面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤口很痛吧，你在流血。为什么怎样舔舐都不起作用呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成为猎物的感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得那些曾被你的齿爪撕裂的生命吗？你有体会到它们的感受吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你和我一样，饥肠辘辘，筋疲力尽。我们都到了最后的时刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有退路了，战斗是我们唯一的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我明白了，或许你需要一些刺激。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（手掌握住锋利的矛头，血顺着手臂流淌而下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闻到了吗？是你喜欢的血的味道，甜美的生命滋味，你恨不得现在就上来撕咬吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要杀死我，这具躯体就能任你享用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有这个本事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畜生！还有这样的力气吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的东西，挪开......你的臭嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如此轻易就被击倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧你的样子，真是可怜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"口口声声地说着杀死野兽，面对垂死挣扎的它却毫无抵抗之力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被压在身下撕扯，就像一块破布，和你真是一样般配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"义冈，这么多年的战斗还不够锤炼你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我没有倒下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是在寄希望于能和它同归于尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真愚蠢，竟然还期望你能做到那些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你做不到，你马上就会在这里倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......绝不会......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就举起你的矛，狠狠地去戳！去刺！去扎进它的身体！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一下！两下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你必须愤怒到豁出性命，愤怒到不顾一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须愤怒到不顾一切，为了你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去杀了它！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没错，是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快，站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你必须让它恐惧你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你闭嘴！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！这可怖的森林的尖牙和利爪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像差一点点就能杀了我，你是这么觉得的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我已经投降了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊！我就在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"猎矛从野兽的咽喉中穿出，老去的躯壳亦轰然倒地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷光倏忽炸裂，映出天穹下的庞大阴影，煌煌的火焰划破阴云。\n他浑身颤抖，指甲深深地嵌入皮肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是它，一定是它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从未见过的怪物......原来如此，就是它把你留在了那里啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你绝不会轻易被野兽打倒，所以，一定没错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会为你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年老的猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当矛头刺穿它的心脏，我会默念你名......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他阖上双眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
